{
  "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
  "sourceName": "Saheeh International",
  "language": "en",
  "direction": "ltr",
  "surahNumber": 77,
  "entries": [
    {
      "verseKey": "77:1",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 1,
      "text": "By those [winds] sent forth in gusts",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:2",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 2,
      "text": "And the winds that blow violently",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:3",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 3,
      "text": "And [by] the winds that spread [clouds]",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:4",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 4,
      "text": "And those [angels] who bring criterion",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:5",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 5,
      "text": "And those [angels] who deliver a message",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:6",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 6,
      "text": "As justification or warning,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:7",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 7,
      "text": "Indeed, what you are promised is to occur.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:8",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 8,
      "text": "So when the stars are obliterated",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:9",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 9,
      "text": "And when the heaven is opened",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:10",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 10,
      "text": "And when the mountains are blown away",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:11",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 11,
      "text": "And when the messengers' time has come...",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:12",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 12,
      "text": "For what Day was it postponed?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:13",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 13,
      "text": "For the Day of Judgement.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:14",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 14,
      "text": "And what can make you know what is the Day of Judgement?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:15",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 15,
      "text": "Woe, that Day, to the deniers.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:16",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 16,
      "text": "Did We not destroy the former peoples?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:17",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 17,
      "text": "Then We will follow them with the later ones.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:18",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 18,
      "text": "Thus do We deal with the criminals.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:19",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 19,
      "text": "Woe, that Day, to the deniers.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:20",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 20,
      "text": "Did We not create you from a liquid disdained?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:21",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 21,
      "text": "And We placed it in a firm lodging [i.e., the womb]",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:22",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 22,
      "text": "For a known extent.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:23",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 23,
      "text": "And We determined [it], and excellent [are We] to determine.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:24",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 24,
      "text": "Woe, that Day, to the deniers.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:25",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 25,
      "text": "Have We not made the earth a container",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:26",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 26,
      "text": "Of the living and the dead?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:27",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 27,
      "text": "And We placed therein lofty, firmly set mountains and have given you to drink sweet water.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:28",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 28,
      "text": "Woe, that Day, to the deniers.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:29",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 29,
      "text": "[They will be told], \"Proceed to that which you used to deny.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:30",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 30,
      "text": "Proceed to a shadow [of smoke] having three columns",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:31",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 31,
      "text": "[But having] no cool shade and availing not against the flame.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:32",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 32,
      "text": "Indeed, it throws sparks [as huge] as a fortress,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:33",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 33,
      "text": "As if they were yellowish [black] camels.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:34",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 34,
      "text": "Woe, that Day, to the deniers.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:35",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 35,
      "text": "This is a Day they will not speak,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:36",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 36,
      "text": "Nor will it be permitted for them to make an excuse.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:37",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 37,
      "text": "Woe, that Day, to the deniers.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:38",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 38,
      "text": "This is the Day of Judgement; We will have assembled you and the former peoples.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:39",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 39,
      "text": "So if you have a plan, then plan against Me.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:40",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 40,
      "text": "Woe, that Day, to the deniers.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:41",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 41,
      "text": "Indeed, the righteous will be among shades and springs",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:42",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 42,
      "text": "And fruits from whatever they desire,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:43",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 43,
      "text": "[Being told], \"Eat and drink in satisfaction for what you used to do.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:44",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 44,
      "text": "Indeed, We thus reward the doers of good.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:45",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 45,
      "text": "Woe, that Day, to the deniers.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:46",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 46,
      "text": "[O disbelievers], eat and enjoy yourselves a little; indeed, you are criminals.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:47",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 47,
      "text": "Woe, that Day, to the deniers.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:48",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 48,
      "text": "And when it is said to them, \"Bow [in prayer],\" they do not bow.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:49",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 49,
      "text": "Woe, that Day, to the deniers.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "77:50",
      "surahNumber": 77,
      "ayahNumber": 50,
      "text": "Then in what statement after it [i.e., the Qur’ān] will they believe?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    }
  ]
}
